PoE Leveling Overlay — third-party attribution
==============================================

The overlay itself is MIT licensed (see LICENSE). This file records where the
data it ships comes from.


Path of Exile Wiki (poewiki.net)
--------------------------------

`data/gems.json` — gem attributes, level requirements and per-class quest/vendor
availability — is derived from the Path of Exile Wiki via its public Cargo query
API (see `scripts/fetch-gem-data.ts`, and the "Fetch gem data" GitHub Action that
refreshes it). No wiki prose is copied; only the structured game facts the tables
expose.

Wiki content is community-contributed and published under the licence stated at
https://www.poewiki.net/wiki/Path_of_Exile_Wiki:Copyrights — consult that page
before redistributing this data outside the overlay.


Route and build-profile content
-------------------------------

None. The campaign routes in `data/campaign/` and the example profile in
`data/profiles/` are written for this project and ship as deliberately thin
placeholders (`"skeleton": true`) for you to replace. No route or quest data is
taken from any other project.


